From bad459347ea87cce525114ad7554f7dd9b7a211e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daniel Illescas Romero <illescas.daniel@protonmail.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 23:41:57 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 35/65] P5b: health regen, CoD stamina, horizontal vital HUD

Player-only CoD health regen (delay/rate), linear stamina with
recharge delay, maxHealth 50, 8s sprint pool, and health/stamina
bars via codmod_hud.pk3 (avoid zz_* pak rename gotcha).

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
